            <sparkle:version>4</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.2.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Vidmark 1.2.0

- Adds secure automatic application updates and a **Check for Updates…** menu command.
- Ignores shared-question events when the incoming question is identical to the local version.
- Shows exact changed fields when reviewing a shared question update.
- Uses Apple Speech for on-device voice-note transcription.
]]></description>
